 "name_en": "Field Logistics Planning and Execution – Direct Procurement (5OM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Field Logistics Planning and Execution – Direct Procurement (5OM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports the logistics between a supplying base and remote locations – receiving products needed for maintenance operations at the base and forwarding them to the remote location, as well as return from the remote back to the base location.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This covers the following supply scenarios (SP15):</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Non-stock items with material master</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Non-stock items without material master (free text items)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The process covers the following return scenarios:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Return to base (to inventory, to scrap, to vendor)</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create maintenance order or EPPM project demand for remote plant with non-stock item (text item or item with material master)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order for remote plant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive items at base with a common browser mobile-enabled UI, including scanning a QR code for receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print labels</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create outbound delivery without reference</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create handling unit</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Orchestrate warehouse processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Receive non-stock item at remote plant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Initiate return from the remote plant</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process returns at base location</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Configure and execute supply and return processing between supplying base and remote locations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate supply processing with plant maintenance, materials management, procurement, and logistics</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate returns processing with materials management, procurement, and logistics</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>现场物流计划与执行 - 直接采购 (5OM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持供应基地和远程位置之间的物流 - 接收基地维护操作所需的产品并将其转发到远程位置，以及从远程位置返回到基地位置。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">这涵盖以下供应场景 (SP15)：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 含物料主数据的非库存项目</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 不含物料主数据的非库存项目（自由文本项目）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">该流程涵盖以下退货场景：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 退货到基地（到库存、报废、到供应商）</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为具有非库存项目（文本项目或含物料主数据的项目）的远程工厂创建维护订单或 EPPM 项目需求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建远程工厂的采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用支持移动设备的通用用户界面在基地接收项目，包括扫描二维码进行接收</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印标签</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建无参考的出库交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建处理单元</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">协调仓库流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在远程工厂接收非库存项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从远程工厂发起退货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在基地处理退货</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea4ca6a0d2724ff49ea74624190cdfc4__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">配置和执行供应基地与远程位置之间的供应和退货处理。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将供应处理与工厂维护、物料管理、采购和物流相集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将退货处理与物料管理、采购和物流相集成</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
